### Catalog entry (`publicSkillBuilderChannelConfig`)

When adding or go-live-ing a provider that already has CLI examples:

1. Add `CHANNEL_PROVIDER_IDENTIFIERS` jq filter ids (match `integrations:list` identifiers).
